              "name": "SecretJwt",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "JSON Web Token"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A hard-coded JWT is a bearer credential: whoever has it is treated as its subject until it expires."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Remove it and obtain tokens at run time. If it was ever valid, revoke it or rotate the signing key.",
                "markdown": "**Why:** A hard-coded JWT is a bearer credential: whoever has it is treated as its subject until it expires.\n\n**Fix:** Remove it and obtain tokens at run time. If it was ever valid, revoke it or rotate the signing key."
